#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Nchọpụta Tebụl Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Otu esi amata tebụl Cacti dị iche na tebụl ndị ọzọ akpọtụrụ na ndekọ ajụjụ nwayọọ. Nke ndabere bụ ịchọpụta tebụl ọ bụla na-enweghị mkpọkọta."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Chọpụta tebụl niile (enweghị mkpọkọta 'OTHER TABLES')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Jiri Nchekwa Data Cacti a; kpọkọta tebụl ndị ọzọ dị ka 'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Chọpụta tebụl niile; kpọkọta tebụl ndị na-adịghị na ndepụta dị n'okpuru dị ka 'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Tebụl Mmasị"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Naanị nhọrọ 'Chọpụta tebụl niile; kpọkọta ... dị ka OTHER TABLES' dị n'elu na-eji ya. Biko nye ndepụta tebụl a maara nke e jiri oghere kewaa iji tụnyere. Na Linux/UNIX, ị nwere ike ịnweta ndepụta tebụl site na iji iwu na-esote:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>A na-eji uru gị dochie uru nke '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', na '<i><b>database</b></i>'."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Oke Mbunye"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Oke nha mbunye faịlụ na Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Nha Faịlụ Mbunye Kacha"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Oke nha faịlụ kacha nke sava Apache gị ga-ekwe ka ebunye ka etọrọ na uru dị n'aka nri.  Ugbu a, ị nweghị ike ibunye faịlụ buru ibu karịa nke a.  Ọ bụrụ na ị nwere ndekọ MySQL Slow buru ibu karịa nke a, ị ga-agbanwerịrị faịlụ <i>php.ini</i> jikọtara na Apache, chọta mgbanwe <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> ma mee ka uru ya bawanye.  Mgbe nke ahụ gasịrị, ị ga-amaliteghachi Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Nha Post Kacha"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Oke nha kacha ị nwere ike iziga na sava Apache ka etọrọ na uru dị n'aka nri.  Ọ bụrụ na ị nwere ndekọ MySQL Slow buru ibu karịa uru a, ị ga-agbanwerịrị faịlụ <i>php.ini</i> jikọtara na Apache, chọta mgbanwe <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> ma mee ka uru ya bawanye.  Mgbe nke ahụ gasịrị, ị ga-amaliteghachi Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Oge Mmezu Kacha"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Ogologo oge (na sekọnd) ekwere ka arịrịọ a rụọ ọrụ; 0 pụtara enweghị oke. Mgbakwunye a na-ebulilarị ya ruo enweghị oke maka arịrịọ nke ya, mana sava weebụ ma ọ bụ prọksị azụ n'ihu PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) ka nwere ike ibipụ arịrịọ ahụ n'onwe ya - enweghị ike ịchọpụta ma ọ bụ imeri nke ahụ site ebe a."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Enweghị Oke"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Oke Ebe Nchekwa (Memory)"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Ego ole ebe nchekwa ekwere ka arịrịọ a jiri; -1 pụtara enweghị oke. Mgbakwunye a na-ebulilarị ya ruo enweghị oke maka arịrịọ nke ya. Nnukwu ndekọ ajụjụ nwayọọ a na-agụ/ebubata n'otu arịrịọ nwere ike ịkarị uru nwere oke."

